@LeavePlanner_HostAddress = http://localhost:5257

### Longest continuous break (live Nager.Holidays data)
POST {{LeavePlanner_HostAddress}}/api/leave-plans/recommendation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "AT",
  "subdivisionCode": null,
  "fromDate": "2026-05-01",
  "toDate": "2026-05-10",
  "leaveBudget": 2,
  "priority": "longestBreak"
}

### Minimum leave, at least seven calendar days
POST {{LeavePlanner_HostAddress}}/api/leave-plans/recommendation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "AT",
  "subdivisionCode": "AT-9",
  "fromDate": "2026-05-01",
  "toDate": "2026-05-31",
  "leaveBudget": 4,
  "priority": "minimumLeave",
  "minTotalDays": 7
}

### Best efficiency, at least three calendar days
POST {{LeavePlanner_HostAddress}}/api/leave-plans/recommendation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "AT",
  "fromDate": "2026-05-01",
  "toDate": "2026-05-31",
  "leaveBudget": 4,
  "priority": "bestEfficiency",
  "minTotalDays": 3
}

### Validation example: minTotalDays is required for bestEfficiency
POST {{LeavePlanner_HostAddress}}/api/leave-plans/recommendation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "AT",
  "fromDate": "2026-05-01",
  "toDate": "2026-05-31",
  "leaveBudget": 4,
  "priority": "bestEfficiency"
}
